Package: ABCmaps
Type: Package
Title: MAPS, PF-IS, and ABC-ASMC Algorithms
Version: 0.10.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Xuefei", "Cao", , "xuefeic@mail.nankai.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Shijia", "Wang", , "wangshj1@shanghaitech.edu.cn", role = "aut"),
    person("Yongdao", "Zhou", , "ydzhou@nankai.edu.cn", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Implements multifidelity adaptive particle sampling (MAPS),
    prior-proposal prefiltered importance sampling (PF-IS), and adaptive
    sequential Monte Carlo ABC (ABC-ASMC). Also provides a pilot diagnostic for
    estimating low-fidelity false-positive and false-negative rates against
    high-fidelity decisions.
